abstract: >-
  Latest bounded source-only CEO compression policy and 41 indexed full-orbital
  molecular conditions. Current-policy executions cover 22 conditions and 66
  starting circuits. Historical records retain distinct methods and budgets.
  Data and documentation use CC-BY-4.0. This private release has no DOI yet.
